{"text":"Then the dark comes. Soot from fires all over the world, and dust from the impact, cover the whole sky. Sunlight can't get through. Plants can't grow. And it gets cold. Scientists think this impact winter lasted months. Maybe years. The world gave you one gift on its last day. Fire. You carried an ember in from the burning forest. You keep a small fire right at the gap, never deep inside. In a closed tunnel, smoke kills quietly. And at night, Pip sleeps against your neck. Two small bodies, keeping each other warm.","alignment":{"characters":["T","h","e","n"," ","t","h","e"," ","d","a","r","k"," ","c","o","m","e","s","."," ","S","o","o","t"," ","f","r","o","m"," ","f","i","r","e","s"," ","a","l","l"," ","o","v","e","r"," ","t","h","e"," ","w","o","r","l","d",","," ","a","n","d"," ","d","u","s","t"," ","f","r","o","m"," ","t","h","e"," ","i","m","p","a","c","t",","," ","c","o","v","e","r"," ","t","h","e"," ","w","h","o","l","e"," ","s","k","y","."," ","S","u","n","l","i","g","h","t"," ","c","a","n","'","t"," ","g","e","t"," ","t","h","r","o","u","g","h","."," ","P","l","a","n","t","s"," ","c","a","n","'","t"," ","g","r","o","w","."," ","A","n","d"," ","i","t"," ","g","e","t","s"," ","c","o","l","d","."," ","S","c","i","e","n","t","i","s","t","s"," ","t","h","i","n","k"," ","t","h","i","s"," ","i","m","p","a","c","t"," ","w","i","n","t","e","r"," ","l","a","s","t","e","d"," ","m","o","n","t","h","s","."," ","M","a","y","b","e"," ","y","e","a","r","s","."," ","T","h","e"," ","w","o","r","l","d"," ","g","a","v","e"," ","y","o","u"," ","o","n","e"," ","g","i","f","t"," ","o","n"," ","i","t","s"," ","l","a","s","t"," ","d","a","y","."," ","F","i","r","e","."," ","Y","o","u"," ","c","a","r","r","i","e","d"," ","a","n"," ","e","m","b","e","r"," ","i","n"," ","f","r","o","m"," ","t","h","e"," ","b","u","r","n","i","n","g"," ","f","o","r","e","s","t","."," ","Y","o","u"," ","k","e","e","p"," ","a"," ","s","m","a","l","l"," ","f","i","r","e"," ","r","i","g","h","t"," "